{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2021-08-26 10:45:00', 'title': 'EQUIFAX BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ATLANTA, AUG. 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EQUIFAX INC. (NYSE: EFX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE EQUIFAX BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.39 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON SEPT.\xa017, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON SEPT.'}